<< /AP << /N 31 0 R >> /BS << /S /I /W .5 >> /DA (/Helv 10 Tf .333333 .333333 .333333 rg) /DV (I [have / do not have] dependents who rely on me. [If yes:] I am the primary caregiver for [describe: my child / my children / my partner / a family member]. Their names and ages are: [list]. They currently receive the following supports: [e.g. FSCD funding / PDD services / specialized school programming / therapy services / medical care from a specialist]. These supports are provided through [describe programs and providers]. If I were forced to relocate, these supports would not automatically transfer. We would need to re-apply in the new province, which could take [estimated time], leaving my dependent\(s\) without support during that period. [If no dependents:] I live alone and manage my disability independently. I do not have family members nearby who are able to provide care or financial support. My support network consists of [describe: medical professionals / community workers / friends / none]. I am the only person responsible for managing my own care and finances. The ADAP transition directly threatens my ability to maintain stable housing and medical care without any family safety net.) /F 4 /FT /Tx /Ff 4096 /MK << /BC [ .733333 .733333 .733333 ] /BG [ 1 1 1 ] >> /MaxLen 100 /P 25 0 R /Rect [ 36 157 576 232 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (pei_dependents) /TU (Describe any dependents or others who would be affected:) /Type /Annot /V (I [have / do not have] dependents who rely on me. [If yes:] I am the primary caregiver for [describe: my child / my children / my partner / a family member]. Their names and ages are: [list]. They currently receive the following supports: [e.g. FSCD funding / PDD services / specialized school programming / therapy services / medical care from a specialist]. These supports are provided through [describe programs and providers]. If I were forced to relocate, these supports would not automatically transfer. We would need to re-apply in the new province, which could take [estimated time], leaving my dependent\(s\) without support during that period. [If no dependents:] I live alone and manage my disability independently. I do not have family members nearby who are able to provide care or financial support. My support network consists of [describe: medical professionals / community workers / friends / none]. I am the only person responsible for managing my own care and finances. The ADAP transition directly threatens my ability to maintain stable housing and medical care without any family safety net.) >>
endobj
